---
title: Siphon by Prima Coffee
source: https://prima-coffee.com/blog/siphon-brewing-guide/
filter: cloth
---

@Siphon 25g 375g 210°F
grind medium-coarse

375g -- in the bottom chamber, then fit the top chamber and heat
0:00 /add-coffee -- once the water has risen
0:00 /stir -- until all is wet
1:30 /stir -- turn off the heat, stir, take it off the burner

target 2:30 -- blow on the bottom chamber to start the drawdown
